      "title": "Add B0x (B Zero X) on Base and Ethereum Mainnet",
      "author": "B0x-Token",
      "number": 1344,
      "body": "Add B Zero X (B0x) token (ETH - Base)\r\n\r\n**Description** A data.json file for B Zero X (B0x) Token for Ethereum and Base Blockchain Contracts \r\nWebsite: https://bzerox.com\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\nIt is a standard ERC20 that has 18 Decimals. Deployed on Base using your Base ERC20 Bridge Maker createOptimismMintableERC20WithDecimals Here: https://basescan.org/tx/0xd42573ac8e80c691c1daa5d499919b9e932162ecaddbea47069b42817c6e1de2\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nAll B0x contracts are verified for our Ethereum and Base deployments on Etherscan and Basescan.\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\nSee data.json",
