    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns74MyXJ",
      "title": "Add B0x (B Zero X) on Base",
      "author": "B0x-Token",
      "number": 1343,
      "body": "Add B Zero X (B0x) token (ETH - Base)\r\n\r\n**Description** A data.json file for B Zero X (B0x) Token for Ethereum and Base Blockchain Contracts  Website: https://bzerox.com\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\nIts supply and token was created on Ethereum. The Optimism contract is a standard ERC20 that has 18 Decimals. Deployed on Base using your Base ERC20 Bridge Maker createOptimismMintableERC20WithDecimals \r\nURL of Creation: https://basescan.org/tx/0xd42573ac8e80c691c1daa5d499919b9e932162ecaddbea47069b42817c6e1de2\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nAll B0x contracts are verified for our Ethereum and Base deployments on Etherscan and Basescan.\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"B Zero X\",\r\n  \"symbol\": \"B0x\",\r\n  \"decimals\": 18,\r\n  \"description\": \"A Version 2 of the 0xBitcoin ERC20 token.  Allows all 0xBitcoin tokens to be upgraded to B Zero X 1:1.  B Zero X or B0x is a Ethereum token whos supply is bridged to Base blockchain to enable proof of work mining and staking on Base Layer 2\",\r\n  \"website\": \"https://bzerox.com\",\r\n  \"twitter\": \"@B0x_Token\",\r\n  \"tokens\": {\r\n    \"ethereum\": {\r\n      \"address\": \"0x1F8f212540B31b37f40D8C57b5c7d8b55bf25919\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"base\": {\r\n      \"address\": \"0x6B19E31C1813cD00b0d47d798601414b79A3e8AD\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
